[source] The supplied fictional fixture asks for a review of error-information loss, compatibility, and a minimal fixture. Its stated API changes from `Result<Record, ParseError>` to `Option<Record>` via `.ok()`. The fixture says a downstream caller uses `parse(text)?` and separately matches `ParseError::InvalidField`; the crate is at 0.8 and follows semantic versioning.

