- **inference:** It satisfies the listed invariants under the stated timestamp profile.
- **source:** The malformed example has an empty ID and `occurredAt: "yesterday"`.
- **inference:** It fails the nonempty-ID and timestamp checks. Its kind and version are allowed.
- **unknown:** These are manual checks of the supplied text; the code was not executed.

